Optional public trust diagnostics acquire vendor data at runtime. No vendor root
bundle or implementation is incorporated into this repository. CCADB data is
attributed to the Common CA Database (CCADB), CDLA-Permissive-2.0:
https://www.ccadb.org/rootstores/usage
Source provenance, notices, external tool licenses and scope limits are documented
in docs/certificate-diagnostics.md. Original source artifacts are retained in the
diagnostic cache. The project license remains AGPL-3.0-only.

Chrome CT log metadata is acquired at runtime from Google's signed v3 list solely
for offline certificate auditing, under the published usage policy at
https://googlechrome.github.io/CertificateTransparency/log_lists.html. No Google
implementation, bundled log keys or log list is redistributed by this project;
source provenance and original signed artifacts remain in the diagnostic cache.
